{"authorID": 11385290, "authorType": 0, "children": [{"authorID": 12935298, "authorType": 1, "children": null, "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 1434047, "commentThreadID": 103127, "createdAt": "2016-06-24T13:15:21Z", "editedAt": null, "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": 1433994, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi Litzia, 
The wings do not charge, you need to remove the iTENS device from the wings with a twist and pull, they are magnetically attached. Once removed, place the device into the charging dock which connects to the power source via the USB charging cord. 

As far as the AC adapter, this accessory was removed from the multi-packs once our initial campaign ended on 4/15, due to the number of international orders. You can purchase the adapter on iTENS.com, or use any standard USB to AC adapter.", "userComment": null}], "childrenTotalCount": 1, "commentID": 1433994, "commentThreadID": 103127, "createdAt": "2016-06-24T06:00:31Z", "editedAt": "2016-06-24T06:00:31Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "HI! I'd like to know how to charge the wings. I did not receive any ac adapter in my variety package.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 12935298, "authorType": 1, "children": null, "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 1434047, "commentThreadID": 103127, "createdAt": "2016-06-24T13:15:21Z", "editedAt": null, "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": 1433994, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi Litzia, 
The wings do not charge, you need to remove the iTENS device from the wings with a twist and pull, they are magnetically attached. Once removed, place the device into the charging dock which connects to the power source via the USB charging cord. 

As far as the AC adapter, this accessory was removed from the multi-packs once our initial campaign ended on 4/15, due to the number of international orders. You can purchase the adapter on iTENS.com, or use any standard USB to AC adapter.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 13634270, "authorType": 0, "children": null, "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 1434035, "commentThreadID": 103127, "createdAt": "2016-04-27T02:09:54Z", "editedAt": null, "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": 1433981, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hello,

So can you also include an additional pad in case the wall adapters are not included anymore.

Also when is the shipping expected to begin?", "userComment": null}
